WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:16.847
The dwarfs stepped out of the mine.

2
00:00:16.848 --> 00:00:20.840
Dar wiped his forehead. "Whew!"

3
00:00:20.841 --> 00:00:23.059
Mar rubbed his belly.

4
00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:28.313
"I hope Snow White made a hot dinner."

5
00:00:28.314 --> 00:00:31.519
"Snow White is wonderful," Par said.

6
00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:34.142
"Why was the queen so nasty to her?

7
00:00:34.143 --> 00:00:36.475
I don't understand."

8
00:00:36.476 --> 00:00:40.956
Gar bit his lip. "I never liked the new queen."

9
00:00:40.957 --> 00:00:45.508
Zar nodded. "She's awful."

10
00:00:45.509 --> 00:00:49.178
"The worst," Yar said.

11
00:00:49.179 --> 00:00:54.596
A tear fell from Star's eye.

12
00:00:54.597 --> 00:00:57.051
Dar patted Star on the shoulder.

13
00:00:57.052 --> 00:00:59.113
"Don't worry, Star.

14
00:00:59.114 --> 00:01:03.719
Snow White is safe with us."

15
00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:22.634
The dwarfs sang as they walked.

16
00:01:22.635 --> 00:01:28.637
But when they got home, the house was dark.

17
00:01:28.638 --> 00:01:31.947
"There's no fire," Dar said.

18
00:01:31.948 --> 00:01:37.079
Mar sniffed. "I don't smell dinner."

19
00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:42.626
"Uh-oh!" The dwarfs rushed into the house.

20
00:01:42.627 --> 00:01:45.415
They gasped.

21
00:01:45.416 --> 00:01:48.414
Snow White lay on the floor.

22
00:01:48.415 --> 00:01:51.390
"She's not breathing!" Par said.

23
00:01:51.391 --> 00:01:54.222
"Get that coat off of her!" Gar said.

24
00:01:54.223 --> 00:01:57.809
Zar and Yar ripped off the coat's buttons.

25
00:01:57.810 --> 00:02:01.092
Star yanked at the sleeves.

26
00:02:01.093 --> 00:02:04.806
Snow White was free!

27
00:02:04.807 --> 00:02:11.196
She opened her eyes. "Oh!

28
00:02:11.197 --> 00:02:14.741
I'm so happy to see you all!"

29
00:02:14.742 --> 00:02:18.705
"What happened?" Dar asked.

30
00:02:18.706 --> 00:02:24.742
Snow White told them about the old woman.

31
00:02:24.743 --> 00:02:35.234
"It must have been the queen!" Dar said.

32
00:02:35.235 --> 00:02:39.492
Meanwhile the queen stood before her mirror.

33
00:02:39.493 --> 00:02:42.743
"My Lady," the mirror said.

34
00:02:42.744 --> 00:02:49.535
"Snow White is still alive—and still beautiful."

35
00:02:49.536 --> 00:02:55.656
The queen screamed.

